{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46830","headline":"荆渚感怀寄僧达禅弟三首 二 · 齐己","name":"荆渚感怀寄僧达禅弟三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十五年前会虎溪，白莲斋後便来西。\n干戈时变信虽绝，吴楚路长魂不迷。\n黄叶喻曾同我悟，碧云情近与谁携。\n春残相忆荆江岸，一只杜鹃头上啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}